30,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"It seems the same people have held the best spots for years without any review. Also, there are many complaints about bikes leaning on each other.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Some spots get soaked in the rain, and I saw people having to move other bikes just to get their own out in the morning.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,May,,"Our shared account is nearly empty, and the ward park is quite expensive with a long waiting list.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,George,,"Managing cash collections is already a chore for the treasurer. Also, those fancy display frames require a lot of physical effort and maintenance.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Mio,,"Some daily riders are actually willing to pay for a spot! But in the next block, charging money caused some neighbors to stop attending meetings.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, that's worrying. If money creates a divide, we should be careful.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Misaki, the leaning bikes and the morning shoving match make it feel like the current system is already failing.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,May,,"@George, if the treasurer is already overwhelmed, we can't add more paperwork.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,George,,Exactly. Any system that requires monthly tracking or heavy maintenance is a bad idea.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, it sounds like the ""best"" spots are the ones that stay dry and are easy to reach.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"If the same people always have the dry spots, it's no wonder there's resentment.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Shizue,,It's a shame. We want everyone to feel welcome and comfortable.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,May,,"If the ward park is full and expensive, people really need a solution here.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,George,,I'm against anything that adds a burden to the association's staff.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Mio,,"But the daily riders are the ones who need the space most, right?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
